 "ejercicios": [
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2019-junio-1",
   "n": 1,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera la función \\(f\\) definida por \\(f(x)=\\dfrac{x^2+3x+4}{2x+2}\\) para \\(x\\neq-1\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,5 p.) Estudia y halla las asíntotas de la gráfica de \\(f\\).",
     "(1 p.) Determina los intervalos de crecimiento y de decrecimiento de \\(f\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p><b>Dominio:</b> \\(\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{-1\\}\\).</p><p><b>Asíntotas verticales.</b> Estudio \\(x=-1\\), que anula el denominador; el numerador vale \\(1-3+4=2\\neq0\\):</p>\\[\\lim_{x\\to-1^-}\\frac{x^2+3x+4}{2x+2}=\\frac2{0^-}=-\\infty\\qquad\\lim_{x\\to-1^+}\\frac{x^2+3x+4}{2x+2}=\\frac2{0^+}=+\\infty\\]<p>Hay asíntota vertical \\(x=-1\\).</p><p><b>Asíntotas horizontales.</b> \\(\\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}f(x)=\\pm\\infty\\): no hay<i class='n' data-t='th'>El grado del numerador (2) supera en una unidad al del denominador (1): no hay horizontal, pero puede haber oblicua.</i>.</p><p><b>Asíntota oblicua</b> \\(y=mx+n\\):</p>\\[m=\\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}\\frac{f(x)}x=\\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}\\frac{x^2+3x+4}{2x^2+2x}=\\frac12\\]\\[n=\\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}\\left(f(x)-\\frac x2\\right)=\\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}\\frac{x^2+3x+4-x^2-x}{2x+2}=\\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}\\frac{2x+4}{2x+2}=1\\]<p>Posición relativa: \\(f(x)-\\left(\\frac x2+1\\right)=\\dfrac1{x+1}\\), positiva en \\(+\\infty\\) (la gráfica va por encima) y negativa en \\(-\\infty\\) (por debajo).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 260' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><line x1='150.0' y1='240.0' x2='150.0' y2='20.0' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><polyline points='20.0,164.4 106.7,136.9 193.3,109.4 280.0,81.9' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='20.0,166.7 22.1,166.0 24.2,165.4 26.4,164.8 28.5,164.1 30.6,163.5 32.7,162.9 34.8,162.3 37.0,161.6 39.1,161.0 41.2,160.4 43.3,159.8 45.4,159.2 47.6,158.5 49.7,157.9 51.8,157.3 53.9,156.7 56.0,156.1 58.2,155.5 60.3,154.9 62.4,154.3 64.5,153.7 66.6,153.2 68.8,152.6 70.9,152.0 73.0,151.4 75.1,150.9 77.2,150.3 79.4,149.8 81.5,149.2 83.6,148.7 85.7,148.2 87.8,147.6 90.0,147.1 92.1,146.6 94.2,146.2 96.3,145.7 98.4,145.3 100.5,144.8 102.7,144.4 104.8,144.1 106.9,143.7 109.0,143.4 111.1,143.1 113.3,142.9 115.4,142.7 117.5,142.6 119.6,142.6 121.7,142.6 123.9,142.8 126.0,143.2 128.1,143.7 130.2,144.5 132.3,145.6 134.5,147.2 136.6,149.6 138.7,153.1 140.8,158.5 142.9,167.6 145.1,185.0 147.2,229.8' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='152.6,7.7 154.7,58.6 156.8,77.4 159.0,87.1 161.1,92.7 163.2,96.4 165.3,98.8 167.5,100.5 169.6,101.7 171.7,102.5 173.8,103.1 176.0,103.4 178.1,103.6 180.2,103.7 182.3,103.7 184.4,103.5 186.6,103.4 188.7,103.1 190.8,102.9 192.9,102.6 195.1,102.2 197.2,101.8 199.3,101.4 201.4,101.0 203.6,100.6 205.7,100.1 207.8,99.6 209.9,99.1 212.1,98.6 214.2,98.1 216.3,97.6 218.4,97.1 220.5,96.5 222.7,96.0 224.8,95.4 226.9,94.8 229.0,94.3 231.2,93.7 233.3,93.1 235.4,92.5 237.5,91.9 239.7,91.4 241.8,90.8 243.9,90.2 246.0,89.6 248.2,88.9 250.3,88.3 252.4,87.7 254.5,87.1 256.6,86.5 258.8,85.9 260.9,85.3 263.0,84.6 265.1,84.0 267.3,83.4 269.4,82.7 271.5,82.1 273.6,81.5 275.8,80.9 277.9,80.2 280.0,79.6' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><text x='152.2' y='26.9' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x = −1</text><text x='228.0' y='69.5' fill='#f0a30a' font-size='10'>y = x/2 + 1</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 130.0H294.0M171.7 254.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='41.7' y1='127.0' x2='41.7' y2='133.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='38.7' y='144.0' font-size='10'>-6</text><line x1='85.0' y1='127.0' x2='85.0' y2='133.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='82.0' y='144.0' font-size='10'>-4</text><line x1='128.3' y1='127.0' x2='128.3' y2='133.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='125.3' y='144.0' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='215.0' y1='127.0' x2='215.0' y2='133.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='212.0' y='144.0' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='258.3' y1='127.0' x2='258.3' y2='133.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='255.3' y='144.0' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='168.7' y1='212.5' x2='174.7' y2='212.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='155.7' y='216.5' font-size='10'>-6</text><line x1='168.7' y1='171.2' x2='174.7' y2='171.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='155.7' y='175.2' font-size='10'>-3</text><line x1='168.7' y1='88.8' x2='174.7' y2='88.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='155.7' y='92.8' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='168.7' y1='47.5' x2='174.7' y2='47.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='155.7' y='51.5' font-size='10'>6</text></svg></div><div class='res'>Asíntota vertical \\(x=-1\\) y asíntota oblicua \\(y=\\dfrac x2+1\\) (en \\(\\pm\\infty\\)). No tiene asíntotas horizontales</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Al ser \\(f\\) racional, el punto «problemático» es \\(x=-1\\), que anula el denominador y no pertenece al dominio<i class='n' data-t='why'>Los puntos «problemáticos» son los que no pertenecen al dominio (por ejemplo, los que anulan un denominador) y los puntos donde cambia la expresión de una función a trozos. Hay que marcarlos en la recta porque en ellos también puede cambiar el signo de la derivada.</i>. Estudiamos el signo de \\(f'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>.</p>\\[f'(x)=\\frac{(2x+3)(2x+2)-2(x^2+3x+4)}{(2x+2)^2}=\\frac{2x^2+4x-2}{(2x+2)^2}=\\frac{x^2+2x-1}{2(x+1)^2}\\]\\[x^2+2x-1=0\\iff x=\\frac{-2\\pm\\sqrt8}2=-1\\pm\\sqrt2\\]\\[\\boxed{x_1=-1-\\sqrt2\\approx-2{,}414}\\qquad\\boxed{x_2=-1+\\sqrt2\\approx0{,}414}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 356 108' width='100%' style='max-width:427px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H342' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M96 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='96' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>x₁</text><path d='M178 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='178' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>−1</text><circle cx='178' cy='52' r='4.5' fill='var(--card,#fff)' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M260 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='260' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>x₂</text><text x='29.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M43.0 40L79.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M70.0 11L79.0 10L77.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='55.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(−3) &gt; 0</text><text x='111.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M125.0 10L161.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M152.0 39L161.0 40L159.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='137.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(−2) &lt; 0</text><text x='193.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M207.0 10L243.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M234.0 39L243.0 40L241.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='219.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(0) &lt; 0</text><text x='275.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M289.0 40L325.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M316.0 11L325.0 10L323.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='301.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(1) &gt; 0</text></svg></div><p>Luego \\(f\\) crece en \\((-\\infty,-1-\\sqrt2)\\) y \\((-1+\\sqrt2,+\\infty)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\gt0\\), y decrece en \\((-1-\\sqrt2,-1)\\) y \\((-1,-1+\\sqrt2)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\lt0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece en él; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i><i class='n' data-t='err'>No se puede escribir que decrece en \\((-1-\\sqrt2,-1+\\sqrt2)\\): ese intervalo contiene \\(x=-1\\), que no está en el dominio.</i>.</p><div class='res'>Crece en \\((-\\infty,-1-\\sqrt2)\\) y \\((-1+\\sqrt2,+\\infty)\\); decrece en \\((-1-\\sqrt2,-1)\\) y \\((-1,-1+\\sqrt2)\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
