    "intro": "Considera las funciones \\(f:(-2,+\\infty)\\to\\mathbb R\\), definida por \\(f(x)=\\ln(x+2)\\) (\\(\\ln\\) denota la función logaritmo neperiano), y \\(g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\), definida por \\(g(x)=\\dfrac12(x-3)\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Esboza el recinto que determinan la gráfica de \\(f\\), la gráfica de \\(g\\), la recta \\(x=1\\) y la recta \\(x=3\\). (No es necesario calcular los puntos de corte entre las dos gráficas).",
     "(1,5 p.) Determina el área del recinto anterior."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(f(x)=\\ln(x+2)\\) es creciente, con asíntota vertical \\(x=-2\\) y corta al eje \\(OX\\) en \\(x=-1\\). \\(g\\) es la recta de pendiente \\(\\frac12\\) que pasa por \\((3,0)\\). En \\([1,3]\\): \\(f(1)=\\ln3\\approx1{,}10\\), \\(g(1)=-1\\); \\(f(3)=\\ln5\\approx1{,}61\\), \\(g(3)=0\\). La gráfica de \\(f\\) queda por encima.</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 220' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='154.2,59.6 156.3,59.1 158.4,58.5 160.5,57.9 162.6,57.3 164.7,56.8 166.8,56.2 168.9,55.7 171.0,55.1 173.1,54.6 175.2,54.1 177.3,53.6 179.4,53.1 181.5,52.6 183.5,52.1 185.6,51.6 187.7,51.1 189.8,50.7 191.9,50.2 194.0,49.7 196.1,49.3 198.2,48.8 200.3,48.4 202.4,48.0 204.5,47.5 206.6,47.1 208.7,46.7 210.8,46.3 212.9,45.9 215.0,45.5 217.1,45.1 219.2,44.7 221.3,44.3 223.4,43.9 225.5,43.5 227.6,43.1 229.7,42.7 231.8,42.4 233.9,42.0 236.0,41.6 238.1,41.3 238.1,99.2 236.0,100.1 233.9,101.0 231.8,101.9 229.7,102.8 227.6,103.7 225.5,104.6 223.4,105.5 221.3,106.4 219.2,107.3 217.1,108.2 215.0,109.1 212.9,110.0 210.8,110.9 208.7,111.8 206.6,112.7 204.5,113.6 202.4,114.5 200.3,115.4 198.2,116.3 196.1,117.2 194.0,118.1 191.9,119.0 189.8,119.9 187.7,120.8 185.6,121.7 183.5,122.6 181.5,123.5 179.4,124.4 177.3,125.3 175.2,126.2 173.1,127.1 171.0,128.0 168.9,128.9 166.8,129.8 164.7,130.7 162.6,131.6 160.5,132.5 158.4,133.4 156.3,134.3 154.2,135.2' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><line x1='28.4' y1='200.0' x2='28.4' y2='20.0' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><polyline points='31.3,194.9 35.5,163.2 39.6,146.6 43.8,135.3 47.9,126.7 52.0,119.8 56.2,114.0 60.3,109.0 64.5,104.6 68.6,100.7 72.8,97.2 76.9,93.9 81.1,91.0 85.2,88.3 89.3,85.7 93.5,83.4 97.6,81.1 101.8,79.1 105.9,77.1 110.1,75.2 114.2,73.4 118.4,71.7 122.5,70.1 126.6,68.5 130.8,67.1 134.9,65.6 139.1,64.3 143.2,62.9 147.4,61.7 151.5,60.4 155.7,59.2 159.8,58.1 164.0,