  {
   "id": "matematicas-2019-junio-8",
   "n": 8,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera el triángulo cuyos vértices son los puntos \\(A(1,1,0)\\), \\(B(1,0,2)\\) y \\(C(0,2,1)\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,25 p.) Halla el área de dicho triángulo.",
     "(1,25 p.) Calcula el coseno del ángulo en el vértice \\(A\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>El área del triángulo es la mitad del módulo del producto vectorial de dos de sus lados<i class='n' data-t='th'>\\(|\\vec u\\times\\vec v|\\) es el área del paralelogramo de lados \\(\\vec u\\) y \\(\\vec v\\); el triángulo es la mitad.</i>:</p>\\[\\overrightarrow{AB}=(0,-1,2)\\qquad\\overrightarrow{AC}=(-1,1,1)\\]\\[\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AC}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\0&-1&2\\\\-1&1&1\\end{vmatrix}=(-3,\\,-2,\\,-1)\\]\\[\\text{Área}=\\frac12\\sqrt{9+4+1}=\\frac{\\sqrt{14}}2\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":33,\"el\":18,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[1,1,0],[1,0,2],[0,2,1]],\"#fcd9a8\",\"#c2410c\"],[\"vec\",[1,1,0],[1,0,2],\"#64748b\",\"\",4,-4],[\"vec\",[1,1,0],[0,2,1],\"#64748b\",\"\",4,-4],[\"pt\",[1,1,0],\"A\",-14,12],[\"pt\",[1,0,2],\"B\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,2,1],\"C\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m19jb4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m19jb4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m19jb4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m19jb4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='118.4,246.0 26.0,18.0 270.7,131.3' fill='#fcd9a8' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#c2410c' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='118.4' y1='246.0' x2='26.0' y2='18.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m19jb4g)'/><line x1='118.4' y1='246.0' x2='270.7' y2='131.3' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m19jb4g)'/><circle cx='118.4' cy='246.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='104.4' y='258.0' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='26.0' cy='18.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='33.0' y='12.0' font-weight='700'>B</text><circle cx='270.7' cy='131.3' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='277.7' y='125.3' font-weight='700'>C</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='15.3' y2='274.1' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='9.2' y='279.6' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='37.4' y2='272.7' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='39.1' y='277.6' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='254.8' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='253.5' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{14}}2\\approx1{,}871\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>El ángulo en \\(A\\) es el que forman \\(\\overrightarrow{AB}\\) y \\(\\overrightarrow{AC}\\):</p>\\[\\cos\\hat A=\\frac{\\overrightarrow{AB}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AC}}{|\\overrightarrow{AB}|\\,|\\overrightarrow{AC}|}=\\frac{0-1+2}{\\sqrt5\\cdot\\sqrt3}=\\frac1{\\sqrt{15}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{15}}{15}\\]<div class='res'>\\(\\cos\\hat A=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{15}}{15}\\approx0{,}2582\\) (\\(\\hat A\\approx75{,}04^\\circ\\))</div></div>"
    }
